CHANGES
=======

Version 0.9.0 - 27 January 2025 (Maintained by Reed-Schimmel)

  MAJOR NEW FEATURES:
  
  * **Cookie Authentication for SSO Users** - Added support for browser session cookie authentication,
    enabling users with Okta SSO (or other SSO providers) to authenticate without API keys
    
  * **Multiple Cookie Input Formats** - Supports cookie strings from Chrome DevTools, Python dictionaries,
    JSON from browser extensions, and cookie files
    
  * **Interactive Cookie Refresh** - Automatically prompts for fresh cookies when session expires,
    with detailed instructions for extraction from Chrome
    
  * **Backward Compatible** - All existing API key authentication code continues to work unchanged
  
  NEW MODULES:
  
  * Added PyBambooHR/cookie_auth.py - Complete cookie parsing and session management
  * Added 38 comprehensive tests in tests/test_cookie_auth.py
  
  IMPROVEMENTS:
  
  * Unified HTTP request handling via _make_request() method
  * Added refresh_cookies() method for updating expired sessions
  * Cookie expiration detection with automatic re-authentication flow
  * Comprehensive documentation in README.md with Chrome cookie extraction guide
  * Updated configuration options in config.py for cookie authentication
  
  MAINTENANCE:
  
  * Project maintainership transferred from smeggingsmegger to Reed-Schimmel
  * All 63 tests passing (38 new cookie auth tests + 25 existing tests)
  * Updated package metadata and classifiers

Version 0.4.2 - 03 October 2014

  * Added row_id to row dictionary to keep track of them in case we need them.

Version 0.3.6 - 03 October 2014

  * Improvements by Ng Zhi An

Version 0.3.1 - 24 February 2014

  * Raise errors on non-200 statuses

Version 0.3.0 - 23 February 2014

  * Company Reports
  * Custom Reports

Version 0.2.0 - 05 October 2013

  * Underscore key support
  * Better test coverage

Version 0.1.0 - 02 October 2013

  * Pre-Alpha version
  * Uses Bamboo HR API to get employee info.
